---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Insights
metaTitle: "Insights on AI in Agriculture — Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko"
metaDescription: "Essays and analysis on AI in agriculture by Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko — precision farming, computer vision, agrifood policy, and the human-first future of food."
---

<section class="hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
  <h1>Notes on AI &amp; <span class="italic-text">Agriculture.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;">
    Essays, talks, and field notes on where artificial intelligence meets agrifood — and the people it should serve.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div style="display: grid; gap: 24px; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="card card--post" href="{{ post.url }}" style="display: block; text-decoration: none;">
      {%- if post.data.hero %}{% set pic = photos[post.data.hero] %}
      <img src="{{ pic.src }}" srcset="{{ pic.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 820px" width="{{ pic.width }}" height="{{ pic.height }}" alt="{{ pic.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="card__body">
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ post.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.event %} · {{ post.data.event }}{% endif %}</span>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="lead" style="text-align: center; color: var(--muted);">New writing is on the way.</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
